<p>SDAR, the strongest diffusion competitor, is also initialized from Qwen3 — but requires 50B tokens of continual pre-training and still loses 7.6 points. Orthrus uses less than 1B tokens and loses zero. The gap is not training scale; it is architecture: Orthrus never modifies the AR weights, so the quality ceiling is the frozen baseline itself.</p>

